      "content": "Hey, i'm studying for a law seminar on the Dobbs case. Can u summarize the main reasoning in the majority opinion and then explain why the dissent's arguments are basically considered legally flawed? thanks. weight on the flaws part pls.mountains of legal theory, just give me the critique. Empty",
